flowchart TD
  %% Handoff Hierarchical ESG Flow (conceptual, updated to reflect code changes)
  Start([Start]) --> LoadData["Load preprocessed report/dataset"]
  LoadData --> Segment["Segment report into content chunks for retrieval"]
  Segment --> Store["Store chunks in retrieval/index store (ChunkStore) via chunk_store.put(report_id, chunks)"]
  Store --> Prepare["Log/Timer: parse timing recorded (Timer.start/stop per domain)"]

  subgraph DomainLoop [Process each ESG domain sequentially]
    direction TB
    DomainStart["Select next domain to evaluate (environmental/social/governance)"] --> Retrieve["Retrieve a broader set of relevant chunks for that domain (HANDOFF_MAX_CHUNKS)"]
    Retrieve --> Partition["Partition retrieved chunks across hierarchical worker groups (split work among HANDOFF_WORKER_GROUPS)"]
    Partition --> ParallelWorkers["Each worker group (WorkerAgent) analyzes its subset in parallel and returns a partial DomainScore (estimate_domain_score)"]
    ParallelWorkers --> MergeDecision["Multiple worker outputs available?"]
    MergeDecision -- Yes --> Merge["Merge worker judgments: average numeric estimates, average confidences, concat rationales; annotate rationale with worker identity"]
    MergeDecision -- No --> SingleAnalyst["Fallback: single analyst forms the domain judgment (estimate_domain_score)"]
    Merge --> FinalizeDomain["Finalize DomainScore with merged score, confidence, rationale, retrieved/used chunk ids"]
    SingleAnalyst --> FinalizeDomain
    FinalizeDomain --> RecordTrace["Record RetrievalEvent(s) per worker and manager (trace of who used which chunks)"]
    RecordTrace --> NextDomain["Store domain score & proceed to next domain"]
  end

  DomainLoop --> Aggregate["Aggregate domain scores into total score & overall confidence (aggregate_total_score, aggregate_confidence)"]
  Aggregate --> Evaluate["Compute metrics: coverage, hallucination, agreement, latency, MAE/accuracy, deliberation (use Timer durations & retrieval trace)"]
  Evaluate --> Compare["Compare predicted total to ground truth (compute error, direction, pct)"]
  Compare --> Result["Produce final run result (pattern=handoff_hierarchical) with domain scores, traces, metrics"]
  Result --> End([End])

  %% Key differences: hierarchical handoff uses ManagerAgent/WorkerAgent, delegates groups via ThreadPoolExecutor; records worker-level RetrievalEvents and a manager-level handoff event; uses HANDOFF_MAX_CHUNKS and HANDOFF_WORKER_GROUPS
  classDef note fill:#fffae6,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px;
  Note["Key: ManagerAgent delegates groups to WorkerAgent instances; worker outputs merged (mean scores, concat rationales); higher agent calls & deliberation; worker identity preserved in rationale"]:::note
  DomainLoop --> Note


